      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Chunking galat  — ek concept do chunks mein bat gaya\n2. Sirf vector search — exact ID / error code / naam miss ho gaya\n3. Reranking nahi  — top-k mein 60% noise chala gaya context mein\n4. Query aur document alag bhasha bolte hain — rewrite/HyDE chahiye\n5. Evaluation nahi — pata hi nahi chalta kaunsa step toota hai",
      "originalText": "1. Chunking galat  — ek concept do chunks mein bat gaya\n2. Sirf vector search — exact ID / error code / naam miss ho gaya\n3. Reranking nahi  — top-k mein 60% noise chala gaya context mein\n4. Query aur document alag bhasha bolte hain — rewrite/HyDE chahiye\n5. Evaluation nahi — pata hi nahi chalta kaunsa step toota hai",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
